Date: Fri, 17 Jun 2022 17:49:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] CHROMIUM: iio/cros_ec_light_prox : Fix 5.15 merging

Use proper callback when controlling a simple sensor: when only one
channel is present, we need to use the common callback to get samples
from the EC FIFO.

Fixes commit 8fbc644519da ("CHROMIUM: iio: cros_ec_light: Fix regular and RGB callbacks")

BUG=none
TEST=compile. Check diff with 5.10 version of the driver for
differences.

Change-Id: I81e43973c03d44f31c1bfe47b0acd0f182cee776
Signed-off-by: Gwendal Grignou <gwendal@chromium.org>
